From: lean <chenlin@fnnas.com>
Subject: [PATCH] iommu: sun55i: update attach_dev callback for Linux 6.18

Accept the previous domain argument introduced by the IOMMU core.
The existing no-op attachment callback does not need to use it.

Signed-off-by: lean <chenlin@fnnas.com>

--- a/drivers/iommu/sun55i-iommu.c
+++ b/drivers/iommu/sun55i-iommu.c
@@ -711,7 +711,8 @@
 }
 
 static int sun55i_iommu_attach_dev(struct iommu_domain *domain,
-				   struct device *dev)
+				   struct device *dev,
+				   struct iommu_domain *old)
 {
 	return 0;
 }
